  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Pohl was known as 'Consultant' amongst the citizens of Kazdel, and is an important figure in maintaining order on the streets. He joined Rhodes Island by the recommendation of Operator Nymph, and assists Rhodes Island's intelligence and communication operations in Kazdel under the code name Mitm."
